  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]Subatomic\nstars are fickle\nIn the dumptruck\nof creation\nAlways flying\nout in pairs\n[D]To the other\n[F]end of Paris\n[C]  [G#dim/B]\n[Am]\nThere's no time to\nsend a message\nThere's no space to\ncross an ocean\nBut they're spinning\nlike true brothers\n[D]Always hip on\n[F]all the others\n[C]  [G#dim/B]\n[Am]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B]Mister Aspect\n[Dm]hide the [Ddim]papers\n[Caug]In a crashing\n[B7]speedy tunnel\n[Ebm]Ghostly pop of\n[Bbm][Bb]transformation\n[C#m]Catch the light in\n[C7]its mutation\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]Sly, [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[F]to the [D]other\n[Am]side [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[G]to the [D]other\n\n[Bridge]\n[Am]side\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Am]Living hidden\ninside slinky\nFrom the egg to\nCrocostimpy\nTurn my head the\nchair collapses\n[D]Into alter-\n[F]nating lapses\n[C]  [G#dim/B]\n[Am]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[B]From the future\n[Dm]waves are [Ddim]coming\n[Caug]Get your senses\n[B7]in the running\n[Ebm]One decision\n[Bb]and it's [Bbm]over\n[C#m]All the others\n[C7]head for Dover\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]Sly, [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[F]to the [D]other\n[Am]side [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[G]to the [D]other\n[Am]Sly, [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[F]to the [D]other\n[Am]side [C]\n[F]Slinky, [D]Sly\n[Am]Slide [C]\n[G]to the [D]other\n[Am]side\n\n[Solo]\n[Am]\n[Bb]  [G]\n\n[Outro]\n[Am7]\n[Am]",
